="00:34.850" end="00:35.810">seemed  </span><span begin="00:35.810" end="00:36.050">to  </span><span begin="00:36.050" end="00:36.680">greet  </span><span begin="00:36.680" end="00:36.920">me  </span><span begin="00:36.920" end="00:37.340">with  </span><span begin="00:37.340" end="00:37.430">a  </span><span begin="00:37.430" end="00:38.330">smile</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.330" end="00:40.640"><span begin="00:38.330" end="00:39.470">Sunspots  </span><span begin="00:39.470" end="00:39.590">have  </span><span begin="00:39.590" end="00:40.640">faded</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.640" end="00:44.420"><span begin="00:40.640" end="00:40.970">And  </span><span begin="00:40.970" end="00:41.750">now  </span><span begin="00:41.750" end="00:42.020">I'm  </span><span begin="00:42.020" end="00:43.160">doing  </span><span begin="00:43.160" end="00:44.420">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.620" end="01:01.760"><span begin="00:54.620" end="00:54.920">Cause  </span><span begin="00:54.920" end="00:54.980">I  </span><span begin="00:54.980" end="00:55.670">fell  </span><span begin="00:55.670" end="00:58.400">on  </span><span begin="00:58.400" end="00:59.090">black  </span><span begin="00:59.090" end="01:01.760">days</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.660" end="01:18.290"><span begin="01:11.660" end="01:13.070">Whomsoever  </span><span begin="01:13.070" end="01:13.280">I've  </span><span begin="01:13.280" end="01:14.330">cured  </span><span begin="01:14.330" end="01:15.560">I've  </span><span begin="01:15.560" end="01:16.820">sickened  </span><span begin="01:16.820" end="01:18.290">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.010" end="01:26.180"><span begin="01:19.010" end="01:20.240">Whomsoever  </span><span begin="01:20.240" end="01:20.390">I've  </span><span begin="01:20.390" end="01:22.490">cradled  </span><span begin="01:22.490" end="01:22.850">I've  </span><span begin="01:22.850" end="01:23.450">put  </span><span begin="01:23.450" end="01:23.990">you  </span><span begin="01:23.990" end="01:26.180">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.180" end="01:29.630"><span begin="01:26.180" end="01:26.270">I'm  </span><span begin="01:26.270" end="01:26.330">a  </span><span begin="01:26.330" end="01:26.990">search  </span><span begin="01:26.990" end="01:27.410">light  </span><span begin="01:27.410" end="01:28.220">soul  </span><span begin="01:28.220" end="01:28.610">they  </span><span begin="01:28.610" end="01:29.630">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.020" end="01:33.470"><span begin="01:30.020" end="01:30.350">But  </span><span begin="01:30.350" end="01:30.530">I  </span><span begin="01:30.530" end="01:30.980">can't  </span><span begin="01:30.980" end="01:31.850">see  </span><span begin="01:31.850" end="01:32.150">it  </span><span begin="01:32.150" end="01:32.390">in  </span><span begin="01:32.390" end="01:32.570">the  </span><span begin="01:32.570" end="01:33.470">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.530" end="01:39.530"><span begin="01:33.530" end="01:34.190">I'm  </span><span begin="01:34.190" end="01:34.670">only  </span><span begin="01:34.670" end="01:36.110">faking  </span><span begin="01:36.110" end="01:36.620">when  </span><span begin="01:36.620" end="01:37.070">I  </span><span begin="01:37.070" end="01:37.850">get  </span><span begin="01:37.850" end="01:38.240">it  </span><span begin="01:38.240" end="01:39.530">right</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.060" end="02:13.250"><span begin="02:11.060" end="02:11.450">How  </span><span begin="02:11.450" end="02:11.780">would  </span><span begin="02:11.780" end="02:11.990">I  </span><span begin="02:11.990" end="02:13.250">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.460" end="02:19.640"><span begin="02:13.460" end="02:13.790">That  </span><span begin="02:13.790" end="02:14.120">this  </span><span begin="02:14.120" end="02:14.390">could  </span><span begin="02:14.390" end="02:14.960">be  </span><span begin="02:14.960" end="0