="03:06.950">fly</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.950" end="03:09.890"><span begin="03:06.950" end="03:07.820">Hands  </span><span begin="03:07.820" end="03:08.000">are  </span><span begin="03:08.000" end="03:08.120">for  </span><span begin="03:08.120" end="03:09.890">shaking</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.920" end="03:13.250"><span begin="03:09.920" end="03:10.280">No</span><span begin="03:10.280" end="03:10.280">,</span><span begin="03:10.280" end="03:10.610">not  </span><span begin="03:10.610" end="03:13.250">tying</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:36.170" end="03:41.210"><span begin="03:36.170" end="03:36.320">I  </span><span begin="03:36.320" end="03:36.710">sure  </span><span begin="03:36.710" end="03:36.980">don't  </span><span begin="03:36.980" end="03:37.280">mind  </span><span begin="03:37.280" end="03:37.400">a  </span><span begin="03:37.400" end="03:41.210">change</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:44.690" end="03:54.890"><span begin="03:44.690" end="03:48.170">But  </span><span begin="03:48.170" end="03:48.380">I  </span><span begin="03:48.380" end="03:49.190">fell  </span><span begin="03:49.190" end="03:52.340">on  </span><span begin="03:52.340" end="03:52.940">black  </span><span begin="03:52.940" end="03:54.890">days</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:04.460" end="04:08.300"><span begin="04:04.460" end="04:04.910">That  </span><span begin="04:04.910" end="04:05.240">this  </span><span begin="04:05.240" end="04:05.480">could  </span><span begin="04:05.480" end="04:06.050">be  </span><span begin="04:06.050" end="04:06.530">my  </span><span begin="04:06.530" end="04:08.300">fate</span></p></div></body></tt>